.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH PDFLUENT-CONVERT 1  "pdfluent 1.1.0" PDFluent
.SH NAME
pdfluent\-convert \- Convert to Word, Excel, PowerPoint, image, or PDF/A
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpdfluent convert\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] <\fB\-\-to\fR> <\fB\-o\fR|\fB\-\-out\fR> [\fB\-q\fR|\fB\-\-quiet\fR] [\fB\-\-dpi\fR] [\fB\-v\fR|\fB\-\-verbose\fR]... [\fB\-\-profile\fR] [\fB\-\-pages\fR] [\fB\-\-raster\fR] [\fB\-\-force\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIINPUT\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Convert to Word, Excel, PowerPoint, image, or PDF/A
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Machine\-readable JSON envelope on stdout
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI<TO>\fR
Conversion target
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
docx: Word document (`.docx`)
.IP \(bu 2
xlsx: Excel workbook (`.xlsx`)
.IP \(bu 2
pptx: PowerPoint deck (`.pptx`)
.IP \(bu 2
png: PNG images, one per page (needs `\-o <dir>`)
.IP \(bu 2
jpeg: JPEG images, one per page (needs `\-o <dir>`)
.IP \(bu 2
pdfa: Archival PDF (PDF/A)
.RE
.TP
\fB\-o\fR, \fB\-\-out\fR \fI<OUT>\fR
Output file, or a directory for images (created when missing). Single\-file targets also accept `\-` for stdout
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Quiet: human mode prints data only (no warnings or progress notes)
.TP
\fB\-\-dpi\fR \fI<DPI>\fR
Render resolution for images (default 150)
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Verbose stderr diagnostics (repeat for more)
.TP
\fB\-\-profile\fR \fI<PROFILE>\fR
PDF/A profile for `\-\-to pdfa` (default a2b)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
a1b: PDF/A\-1b
.IP \(bu 2
a2b: PDF/A\-2b (default)
.IP \(bu 2
a3b: PDF/A\-3b
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-pages\fR \fI<PAGES>\fR
Page range for images, e.g. `1\-3` (single range only)
.TP
\fB\-\-raster\fR \fI<RASTER>\fR
Raster pipeline for images: `quality` (default, f32) or `speed` (u8, faster)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
quality: Higher\-precision f32 pipeline (default, historical output)
.IP \(bu 2
speed: Faster u8 pipeline (~1.4–1.6× on content\-heavy pages)
.RE
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Overwrite existing output files
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
<\fIINPUT\fR>
Input PDF, or `\-` for stdin
.SH VERSION
v1.1.0
